                        "id": "317",
                        "name": "Google 翻訳",
                        "type": "url",
                        "url": "https://translate.google.com/?hl=ja#en/ja/Banking%20group%20Santander%20will%20be%20partnering%20with%20Ripple%20to%20release%20an%20international%20money%20transfer%20app%20using%20Ripple%E2%80%99s%20Blockchain%20xCurrent%20and%20RippleNet%20platforms%2C%20Business%20Insider%20reports%20today%2C%20March%2024.%0A%0AWhen%20speaking%20about%20the%20upcoming%20app%20release%20at%20the%20International%20Fintech%20conference%20in%20London%20yesterday%2C%20March%2023%2C%20Nathan%20Bostock%2C%20the%20UK%20CEO%20of%20Santander%20said%3A%0A%E2%80%9CThis%20spring%2C%20if%20not%20%5Bsic%5D%20one%20beats%20us%20to%20it%2C%20we%20will%20be%20the%20first%20large%20retail%20bank%20to%20carry%20out%20cross-border%20payments%20at%20scale%20with%20Blockchain%20technology.%E2%80%9D%0AAt%20the%20end%20of%20January%20of%20this%20year%2C%20Ana%20Botin%2C%20the%20CEO%20of%20Santander%2C%20had%20mentioned%20the%20app%20launch%20in%20the%20company%E2%80%99s%202017%20earnings%20presentation%2C%20noting%20that%20it%20will%20be%20open%20to%20Spain%2C%20Brazil%2C%20the%20United%20Kingdom%2C%20and%20Poland.%0A%0AAccording%20to%20Business%20Insider%2C%20Santander%20had%20invested%20in%20Ripple%20in%202015%20and%202016.%20The%20two%20companies%20tested%20an%20international%20payment%20app%20with%20test%20trials%20in%202016%20that%20showed%20that%20Ripple%E2%80%99s%20technology%20concluded%20transfers%20in%20less%20than%20a%20day.%20The%20payment%20app%20will%20also%20be%20able%20to%20show%20an%20estimate%20of%20the%20cost%20of%20a%20money%20transfer.%0ASo%20far%20this%20year%20Ripple%20has%20partnered%20with%20MoneyGram%20to%20speed%20fiat%20settlements%2C%20a%20consortium%20of%2061%20Japanese%20banks%20for%20creating%20an%20instant%20domestic%20payments%20app%2C%20and%20a%20South%20Korean%20bank%20for%20%E2%80%9Ccommercial%E2%80%9D%20international%20remittances%2C%20among%20others."
                     }, {
